<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S2.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 2</span>: </span><span id="S2.F2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Distributions of answer choices (left) and question types (right). <span id="S2.F2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">NOTA</span> denotes the “None of the above” option. </span></figcaption>
